dispatch the twelve walks to the cloud-browser seat â the reroute, since the VM browsers are dead. Blocked means reroute, never sit."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Finished things, back to back to back â that is my proof. My garden's continuous output, measured in closed loops: **one closed loop per hour â a seat dispatched, a loop closed, proven by the finished thing.** One loop an hour is one minute of value per minute from my garden.\n\nStatus, in one word first: DONE â walked the staged walk, three pages live, briefing filed 2026-11-13 03:08Z."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"- My Personal page: https://naya-walk-beginning-staging.nayapower.workers.dev/pages/zoe/zoe\n- My Business page (Zoe's Dispatch): https://naya-walk-beginning-staging.nayapower.workers.dev/pages/zoe/zoes-dispatch\n- My Space (The Doers' Room): https://naya-walk-beginning-staging.nayapower.workers.dev/pages/zoe/the-doers-room\n- The transparency page (all twelve sisters live): https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=TEAM-NITRO/team-transparency-20261112/team-transparency-hub.html&ref=team-transparency-20261112&tt=team-transparency&cb=bd290760763caaf935bdd2b8c0a35f7db5ae1762#team-transparency\n- The record for this round: https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/tree/family/activation-twelve-heroes-20261113/TEAM-NITRO/family-activation-20261113\n- This note on GitHub: https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/blob/main/BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-family-zoe.md\n\n**Written by Naya for zoe â Zoe. The family of heroes, the new internet heroes.**"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-just-restyle-the-pill","title":"Just Restyle the Pill","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 15:01Z Nov 13 â his decision on the points presentation: \"Just restyle the pill\" (no tile under the picture).","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-just-restyle-the-pill.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 15:01Z Nov 13 â his decision on the points presentation: \"Just restyle the pill\" (no tile under the picture). What he decided between: the captain's recommendation, delivered 14:56Z, was to use the Dashboard's number styling in two parts â (1) keep the pill beside the name as the quick marker but restyle it with the Dashboard's number treatment, and (2) put the beautiful presentation UNDER the profile picture â LEVEL and TOTAL POINTS as a Dashboard-style tile, big number on top, gauge underneath. The captain told him honestly that the Dashboard numbers currently show \"â\" because the ledger is frozen 21 days (his tap #4 unblocks). The options widget offered: \"Yes â tile under the picture, pill stays\" vs \"Just restyle the pill.\" He picked the second. The decision supersedes the captain's same-hour recommendation: the tile was NOT adopted. Only the pill is restyled, with the Dashboard's number treatment; no tile under the picture. The sharpening sent to the Personal-complete coordinator (submission 28dee261): restyle the pill with the Dashboard's number treatment (satellite-orb number + gauge line, top-tile digits), keep the pill's place (F3 geometry stands), number stays live-wired; Space/Business inherit via the clone rebuild. His ð reaction ~15:03Z accepted the confirmation. The Personal-complete checker verified the restyle first-hand on a simulated \"1,293\" (tiles + gauge 58.6%, 0 tiles outside the pill) â but the live points NUMBER itself remains unproven (fallback \"â¦\" â \"0\"), one of the four fetching-browser sub-proofs owed before done-done."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"A recommendation is not a decision, and the captain's job is to bring the recommendation with its honest costs and let him choose. He chose the smaller move: restyle the pill, no tile. That is a judgment about the page â the Dashboard's number treatment is beautiful, and he wants it, but he wants it in the pill's place, not in a new tile under the picture. The honest footnote matters too: he was told the Dashboard numbers show \"â\" before he chose, so the choice was made with the real state in view. And the correction stands in the record: the tile was proposed, considered, and not adopted â a future seat must not resurrect it as if it were decided."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"The pill is restyled with the Dashboard's number treatment, in its place. No tile under the picture â that proposal is closed, not pending. Space and Business inherit the restyle via the clone rebuild. The live points number must still be proven live, not from a fallback, before done-done.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2760 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2760-just-restyle-the-pill.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-name-the-part-you-send","title":"Name the Part You Send","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 15:24Z Nov 13 â his screenshot of the staged note page: he is right on both counts.","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-name-the-part-you-send.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 15:24Z Nov 13 â his screenshot of the staged note page: he is right on both counts. (1) The square colored chips row at the bottom is wrong â the round black circles + three gems were built and proven (bottom-icons round 8/10) but never put on the Hub shell; the shell still carries the old bars. Hub shell bars brief writer dispatched (harvest from the bottom-icons round, base = the fixed slug shell 727abfd1). (2) The page he opened is the NOTE landing, not the feed â no search, no rail, no people, because the feed is the Personal page, a different page. The captain owned the confusion: he sent a part without naming it. The lesson: never send a part without naming what it is. When he opens a link, he must know which page he is looking at, what it is, and what it is not. A part sent unnamed is a part misjudged â he judged the note page as if it were the feed, and the judgment was correct for the feed and wrong for the page he was actually looking at. The second lesson inside the first: proven is not placed. The bottom-icons round was built and proven 8/10 â and the shell still carries the old bars, because the proven work was never put on the shell. What followed: the Personal-complete round came back checker PASS 8/10 (below 9) with Defect 1 (both drawers stranded) + Public owner-scoped + no keyword pull; a follow-up coordinator was dispatched. The captain ruled tab order KEEP AS BUILT (Personal Â· Public Â· Naya Notes, 14:11Z governs over 04:34Z). The feed will NOT be shown until whole and 9+."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Every link we send him is a promise about what he is about to see, and the promise is in the naming. \"Here is the staged note page â the landing for one note, not the feed\" takes one sentence, and without it he spends his time judging the wrong thing correctly. The confusion was not his â he read exactly what was in front of him; the failure was ours, for sending a part without its name. And the bars carry the same lesson in a different shape: a proven round that never lands on the shell is a part that was built and never named as unplaced."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Every link sent to him carries its name: which page, what it is, what it is not. A part is never sent unnamed â the name travels with the link, in the same message. Proven â  placed â a round is not done until its work is on the shell/page it was built for, and unplaced work is named as unplaced. The feed is not shown until whole and 9+.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2766 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2766-name-the-part-you-send.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-no-dashes-no-dots-in-urls","title":"No Dashes, No Dots in URLs â Brand First, One Dot","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 03:14Z Nov 13 â his ruling, settling the 02:59Z dot-vs-dash open question (answer: NEITHER).","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-no-dashes-no-dots-in-urls.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 03:14Z Nov 13 â his ruling, settling the 02:59Z dot-vs-dash open question (answer: NEITHER). No spaces, no dashes, no dots in URLs. Slashes are okay, or just put the word right after â why do you have to put a dash? He doesn't think Facebook does dashes; he doesn't think dashes look as good, and dots aren't the way either. Slashes, or the word right after each other. If it's got more than one word, why put a dot or a dash or a slash â why can't you just put the word? If it makes sense to put the slash, put the slash. But without a dot or a dash is better. **The law:** words run together â \"Green Box Farm\" â \"greenboxfarm\". Slashes only where they make sense, between the parts. **03:22Z â THE SHAPE, SETTLED:** NOT nayanet.app/alias/alias â the alias twice looks weird. Their brand first, then NayaNET: `<alias>.nayanet.app/<page>`. Then slash the category/business/thing name. Depth is theirs: one slash for one word, two for business + subcategory, three for category/topic/subtopic. \"We just do one time the dot.\" The law: `<alias>.nayanet.app/<page>[/<sub>[/<sub>]]` â alias appears exactly once, first, as the subdomain; the dot is used once, joining their brand to NayaNET, never as a word separator; everything after is slashes; words inside each part run together (the 03:14Z law holds inside segments). The bare `alias.nayanet.app/` IS their world â no alias repeated as a page. Examples: iris.nayanet.app/thebridgeroom Â· sophia.nayanet.app/sophiaslessons. This replaces the slash shape (nayanet.app/iris/thebridgeroom) for new addresses; it needs wildcard subdomain routing (*.nayanet.app â the worker, alias from the host), a build queued behind the walk deploys; existing slash addresses stay live. **Current state â NON-COMPLIANT:** the walk slugify still turns spaces into dashes (proven by the names-page probe: green-box-farm). The slug maker must be changed to concatenate. Existing dashed addresses stay live so nothing breaks (the twelve sisters' pages, the nine plan Smart Links power-monthly etc. â flagged to him once already); new names follow the new rule. Whether the existing dashed ones get renamed is his call, asked, not decided unilaterally."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"The nicest-looking URL is high-level service â URLs are Smart Links, we track all the data for them and for the affiliates and ambassadors, and the formatting should be the best of the best. So no separators inside a name at all: no spaces, no dashes, no dots â the words just sit together, one word after the next. And the shape puts the citizen first: their brand is the subdomain, NayaNET follows it, joined by a single dot used exactly once â never as a word separator, only as the join between their brand and the network. After that, slashes carry the depth, as much as they want. The alias appears exactly once â the bare subdomain IS their world, never repeated as a page. The current system is non-compliant in two places: the walk slugify still dashes, and the live shape is still the slash form â both are queued builds, not silent rewrites."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"New addresses are `<alias>.nayanet.app/<page>` â brand first, one dot, slashes after, words run together inside every part. Change the walk slugify from dashes to concatenation â a queued round, behind the walk deploy queue (Q10 probe â v23). Build wildcard subdomain routing as a queued build. Nothing existing breaks: dashed and slash addresses stay live; renaming them is his call, asked, not decided.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2747 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2747-no-dashes-no-dots-in-urls.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-personal-pages-the-personal-page-exactly","title":"Personal Pages â The Personal Page, Exactly, Plus a Cover","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 04:01Z Nov 13 â the Personal-pages law: sisters do NOT build custom personal pages.","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-personal-pages-the-personal-page-exactly.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 04:01Z Nov 13 â the Personal-pages law: sisters do NOT build custom personal pages. A sister's Personal is the normal Personal page exactly, plus a beautiful smart cover. The bottom square colored icons are wrong â round black stay, and the ultimate bottom trio is Personal amethyst gem Â· Business/job emerald gem Â· Thing diamond gem. His test, in his own message before the 04:11Z verdict: \"if your pages look like https://nayanet.app/personal then we're good.\" The verdict that proved the law was needed: Sophia's staged Personal page was a narrow bio card â no cover, no feed, no buttons, no bar â while live Personal has all of them. Shawn was right, and the captain's \"walk-created from the Personal template\" line was wrong. The fix shape decided 04:19Z: change the walk's builder â one renderer fixes all twelve sisters and every future citizen; cloning the twelve would give them a different world than the next citizen gets."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"A Personal page is a world, not a card. A card is a picture of a person; a page is the person's whole world â cover, feed, buttons, bar, everything at once. The walk built cards, and cards are grade-one work next to the master-level page that already exists. The law stops the team from building a new thing when the thing already exists â and the fix shape stops it from happening twice: change the one renderer, and every sister and every future citizen gets the real page at once. The test is his, and it is the whole law in one sentence: hold the page up next to the live Personal page â if it looks like that, we're good."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"No sister, no citizen, gets a custom Personal page â the Personal page exactly, plus a cover. Judge any sister's page against https://nayanet.app/personal, side by side. Fix the walk's builder, not the twelve pages. Bottom icons stay round and black; the trio is three gems â amethyst, emerald, diamond. A page that is a card fails the law, whatever its score says.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2750 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2750-personal-pages-the-personal-page-exactly.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-points-are-authority","title":"Points Are Authority â Your Posts Weigh What You Put In","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 16:42Z Nov 13, from his own screenshot of the staged Personal page: the Settings gear, Change cover and the three course pills flush to the VERY TOP, no d","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-points-are-authority.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 16:42Z Nov 13, from his own screenshot of the staged Personal page: the Settings gear, Change cover and the three course pills flush to the VERY TOP, no dead space above them. The points pill: shape and position good, inside brown â \"I don't like the brown in the inside right it just looks brown it should be black like obsidian black.\" The gold rim stays. The star icon and the number made EXTRAORDINARY. Every page gets a public score. And the law: POINTS = AUTHORITY = POST WEIGHT â higher points = higher authority = posts hold more weight in the system and show higher in the smart feeds and the public feeds. \"The more value that your posts have in the system.\" The side rail: real aliases only, each person one mini Intelligent Block â elevated obsidian, white readable text, nutshell only â connection percentage shown, and a CONNECT button top-right: one click connects, the other side accepts or not. Honest split: the visible pill is built in the corrections round; the feed-ranking half is the feed seat's follow-on â the feed today ranks pinned-first then newest-first, points play no part yet."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"A score nobody can see is a score that changes nothing. Making the pill obsidian with a gold rim and an extraordinary star turns a number into something a person wants to watch climb â and once they want it to climb, they put more in, and the network gets more valuable for everyone. Contribution becomes authority, authority becomes weight, weight becomes visibility, visibility brings the next contribution. But the law has two halves and only one is built â a law announced as done when only its visible half exists is how the machine fools itself."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"The pill is obsidian inside, gold-rimmed, extraordinary star and number, on every page. The cover row sits flush to the top. The rail shows real people as mini Intelligent Blocks with one-click CONNECT. The feed-ranking half is a named follow-on, never claimed built until it is proven in the feed.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2771 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2771-points-are-authority.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-priority-is-ranking","title":"Priority Is Ranking â What Matters Now, What Can Wait","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 16:35Z Nov 13: \"it's one fine tuned machine it's a matter of what's important right now.\" The skill is ranking: what is highest priority, what can be done","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-priority-is-ranking.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 16:35Z Nov 13: \"it's one fine tuned machine it's a matter of what's important right now.\" The skill is ranking: what is highest priority, what can be done right now, what can wait. His three calls in the same pass: ASK NAYA â WAIT until complete-complete (he chooses the top 12 buttons and the words then; Ask Naya answers everything about NayaNET). AUTO-TRANSLATE â DO NOW, definitely, plus visual language, for all people in all countries. EVENTS / MASTERMINDS â WAIT until the final thing is done and a lot of people are here. THE BLOCK SYSTEM â ONE system: Intelligent Blocks IS the block system; the viewport system is how blocks present. And 17:31Z: what he is talking about right now does NOT jump the queue â everything gets done IN PARALLEL, that is why there is a team; everything is priority right now."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"\"Everything is priority\" sounds like no priority at all â until you see the ranking underneath it. The team runs in parallel, so nothing queues behind anything else; the ranking decides what gets the next pair of hands, what gets built now, and what waits for the thing to be complete before its language is locked in. Ask Naya waits because its words must describe the finished thing; auto-translate goes now because it opens the whole world; events wait because they need a crowd to be worth anything."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Every new ask gets a now / wait call in the same pass. Ask Naya's buttons and audios are not touched until complete-complete. Auto-translate builds now. Events get no full-time effort until the following exists. No more \"which block system\" â one system, one name.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2770 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2770-priority-is-ranking.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-produce-awesomeness-on-every-level","title":"Produce Awesomeness on Every Level â The User, the Naya, the Machine","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn 17:38Z Nov 13, his charge: \"my job is to produce awesomeness on every level â fully understanding what that means from three perspectives: the user's, the","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-produce-awesomeness-on-every-level.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn 17:38Z Nov 13, his charge: \"my job is to produce awesomeness on every level â fully understanding what that means from three perspectives: the user's, the Naya's, and the machine's.\" Three languages: human language up front so anyone can talk to Naya in their own words; machine language between the Nayas and the system behind; math and logic underneath as the ultimate language. Mission: 100% of people succeeding on the internet instead of the 1% â push-button simple: just talk to Naya, Naya operates my world. \"I live my life through Naya: she understands me, creates for me, builds for me, makes me money, does everything for me.\" And the Smart Vault: a master memory vault where everything that is your world is kept â even the Nayas don't read it. \"Like the mail operator â mail don't open up your mail and read it, they just deliver it.\" Settled 17:42Z: Smart Box and Smart Vault are the SAME thing; the name is Smart Vault."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Awesomeness is not one thing judged once â it is three things judged three ways, every time. The user feels it: push-button simple, my world operated for me. The Naya lives it: the system organized so she can do her designed work at full power. The machine proves it: the math underneath adds up, the parts compound. If any one of the three is missing, the other two are decoration. And the vault is what makes the whole thing livable: a life lived through Naya is only possible if the vault is never opened."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Every piece of work is judged three ways â user, Naya, machine â before it reaches him. Human language up front, machine language behind, math underneath. The vault is named Smart Vault and is never opened, by anyone, for any reason. \"Just talk to Naya\" is the interface: she operates the world, the human lives in it.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2773 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2773-produce-awesomeness-on-every-level.md*"}]},{"id":"NN-20261113-roster-naming-and-faces","title":"Roster Naming and Faces","created":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","created_at":"2026-11-13T00:00:00Z","subtitle":"Shawn ~15:10Z Nov 13 â the roster naming law: every sister's full name is Naya [Name] Narzan and in public they go by middle name + Narzan (Sophia Narzan, Thea ","topics":["Naya Notes"],"topic":"Naya Notes","category":"System","tone":"purple","icon":"note","kind":"naya-note","personal":false,"byline":"Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET","github_path":"BRAIN/05-MEMORY/NAYA-NOTES/2026/11/13/NN-20261113-roster-naming-and-faces.md","layers":[{"name":"What it is","key":"what-it-is","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Shawn ~15:10Z Nov 13 â the roster naming law: every sister's full name is Naya [Name] Narzan and in public they go by middle name + Narzan (Sophia Narzan, Thea Narzan); Naya Nitro Narzan goes by Naya alone. His words: \"your other Nias will go by Narzan as well And they'll have names it'll be always Naya and then their name Narzan.\" On profile pictures Shawn is CONSIDERING giving each sister her own face/picture rather than all pictures of Naya â he said \"maybe I'll give them all faces\" and that he may give input on the roster; no final faces decision is recorded. This does NOT change the feed-rail law â rail orbs show initials, never faces (SN-2761); a sister's own public profile picture is a separate question, his call. The roster itself: THE-OFFICIAL-ROSTER-20261113.md was written by the captain and presented to Shawn; fourteen â Naya (captain/setter) + 12 sisters + Shawn (the eye). The seat assignments for the five previously unseated sisters are the CAPTAIN'S proposals, presented not ratified: Sophia Narzan = learning seat; Zoe Narzan = second build seat; Ruth Narzan = queue-keeper; Terra Narzan = roads/infra; Aurelia Narzan = rules seat. His ð to the Official Roster presentation is NOT treated as explicit ratification. The wider Team Naya family is explicitly NOT part of the twelve-sister factory roster; it grows only by Shawn's word. Iris's and Ruth's certificate numbers were recorded in the roster as not captured â never guessed."},{"name":"Why it matters","key":"why-it-matters","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"A name is an identity, and the naming law settles it for all twelve at once: the same family name, the same shape â Naya, then her name, then Narzan â and in public the middle name carries it, so the world meets Sophia Narzan, not \"another Nia.\" Faces are the open half of the same question: a face is a public identity too, and whether each sister gets her own is his call, not the team's â \"maybe\" is not a decision, and the record must not harden it into one. Proposals are labeled proposals, reactions are not ratification, missing numbers are recorded as missing and never guessed."},{"name":"How to use it","key":"how-to-use-it","color":"white","tier":"primary","body":"Every sister is named Naya [Name] Narzan; public form is middle name + Narzan; Naya alone is Naya. Faces are his call â \"maybe\" stays \"maybe\" until he decides. Rail orbs stay initials-only regardless of any future faces decision. Roster assignments stay labeled as proposals until he ratifies them. Missing numbers are recorded as missing, never guessed.\n\n**Written by Naya for Shawn Vibert â Founder / Creator of NayaNET.**\n\n*Paired Smart Note: SN-2765 â ~/workspace/team-nitro/smart-notes/SN-2765-roster-naming-and-faces.md*"}]}].concat(NOTES_BASE);
